3. Source-guide quotations (third-party content cited under fair use)

Every direct quotation from a source guide in this commons is the
copyright of its respective publisher and appears here as a short
fair-use excerpt (each quote under 50 words, with full attribution to
publisher, year, and source URL).

These quotations are NOT licensed under CC BY 4.0 by virtue of their
inclusion here. Reuse beyond fair-use citation requires permission from
the original publisher.

The full list of source publishers, with current contact information,
appears on each source page at:
  https://equitylanguagecommons.org/sources/

