In summary
----------

If you're reusing the COMMONS'S OWN WORK (synthesis, principles,
schema), follow CC BY 4.0.

If you're reusing the CODEBASE, follow MIT.

If you're reusing SOURCE-GUIDE QUOTATIONS, contact the original
publisher.
